\par 
\par \tab }{\b\i\f0\fs24\ul\cf1\cgrid0\insrsid725817\charrsid14172804 \'a7i\'d2u2}{\f0\fs24\cf1\cgrid0\insrsid725817\charrsid14172804 :   L\'ad\'acng v\'b5 c\'b8c kho\'b6n ph\'f4 c\'cap trong th\'eai gian \'aei h\'e4c v\'b5 th\'f9c t\'cbp t\'b9i C\'e9ng ho\'b5
 Ph\'b8p c\'b8c \'ae\'e5ng ch\'dd h\'e4c vi\'aan \'ae\'ad\'eec h\'ad\'ebng theo ch\'d5 \'ae\'e9 \'ae\'e8i v\'edi ng\'ad\'eai \'aei h\'e4c \'eb n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i hi\'d6n h\'b5nh.
\par 
\par \tab }{\b\i\f0\fs24\ul\cf1\cgrid0\insrsid725817\charrsid14172804 \'a7i\'d2u 3}{\f0\fs24\cf1\cgrid0\insrsid725817\charrsid14172804 :  Quy\'d5t \'ae\'denh n\'b5y c\'e3 hi\'d6u l\'f9c  t\'f5 ng\'b5y k\'fd. C\'b8c \'ae\'e5ng ch\'dd V\'f4 tr\'ad\'ebng V\'f4 T
\'e6 ch\'f8c c\'b8n b\'e9 v\'b5 \'a7\'b5o t\'b9o, V\'f4 tr\'ad\'ebng V\'f4 Quan h\'d6 qu\'e8c t\'d5, Gi\'b8m \'ae\'e8c d\'f9 \'b8n ASSUR, Th\'f1 tr\'ad\'ebng c\'b8c \'ae\'acn v\'de c\'e3 ng\'ad\'eai \'aei h\'e4c v\'b5 \'aei th\'f9c t\'cbp v\'b5 c\'b8c 
\'ae\'e5ng ch\'dd c\'e3 t\'aan \'eb \'aei\'d2u 1  ch\'deu tr\'b8ch nhi\'d6m thi h\'b5nh quy\'d5t \'ae\'denh n\'b5y./.
\par 
